ilà au coeur du désert, prêt à se fondre dans cet univers inhospitalier, mais toujours suivi, à quelque distance, par son frère Simon, plus que jamais décidé à le rattraper. Or le Grand Désert est aussi le domaine des Zaks, les hommes-masques aux yeux sanguins. N'est-ce qu'un peuple de légende, où sont-ils vraiment là, cachés dans un dédale de galeries souterraines labyrinthiques ?Dayak ne tardera pas à être fixé . Bientôt résonneront les tambours des traditions humaines les plus anciennes, et les ombres démesurées des silhouettes primitives viendront s'allonger auprès de lui.Grâce à leur intervention, Dayak parviendra à triompher définitivement de son frère, si tant est que la mort, pour les gens de son espèce, soit vraiment une fin...Alors, qui sont au juste ces Zaks qui s'expriment en ces lieux désertiques ?Et si Dayak, d'une certaine façon, finissait par devenir l'un des leurs ?...","classification":"760","contributors":[{"name":"Adamov, Philippe","nature":"person","role":"autor","role_code":"070","primary":true,"dates":"1956-....","authority_ref":null,"tag":"700"}]}},{"row_no":10,"external_key":"10","item_type":"am","title":"La chambre verte","subtitle":null,"responsibility_statement":"Adamov, Philippe","authors":["Adamov, Philippe"],"publisher":"Glénat","place_of_publication":"Grenoble","publication_year":"1994","edition_statement":null,"language":"fre","isbn":"2-7234-1727-1","issn":null,"subjects":["Science-fiction"],"raw_payload":{"leader":"02303nam0 22002651i 450 ","fields":[{"tag":"001","value":"10"},{"tag":"100","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"20050101u        u  u0frey50  "}]},{"tag":"009","value":"  \u001fa1994-01-01\u001fc2005-01-01 00:00:00\u001fu2010-09-21 13:55:07"},{"tag":"200","ind1":"1","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"La chambre verte"}]},{"tag":"010","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"2-7234-1727-1"}]},{"tag":"101","ind1":"0","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"fre"}]},{"tag":"215","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"47 p."},{"code":"c","value":"ill. en coul., couv. ill. en coul."},{"code":"d","value":"32 cm"}]},{"tag":"330","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"La nouvelle Addis Abeba est née !Fini le ghetto, sa misère et sa crasse... Simon Colbius, leader de la C.P.M., a fait surgir une mégalopole où les techniques les plus sophistiquées côtoient les traditions les plus anciennes.Un monde où P'tit Caille est devenu le valet de chambre du nouveau despote et Cori une courtisane que le nouveau comportement de Dayak trouble à peine.Car Dayak sait maintenant qu'il est le frère de Simon, il a retrouvé dans de lointains souvenirs la vision fugace de cette Chambre verte où, enfants, ils percevaient les formidables changements que leur père orchestrait.Devenu le clone de Simon, Dayak parviendra-t-il à briser les chaînes qui le relient à ce frère qui se rêve maître de l'Afrique et empereur d'un nouvel âge ?"}]},{"tag":"319","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Aucun droit spécifique"}]},{"tag":"700","ind1":" ","ind2":"1","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Adamov"},{"code":"b","value":"Philippe"},{"code":"4","value":"070"},{"code":"f","value":"1956-...."},{"code":"N","value":"http://www.lambiek.net/fr/adamov_philippe.html"},{"code":"9","value":"id:9"}]},{"tag":"210","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Grenoble"},{"code":"b","value":"Grenoble"},{"code":"c","value":"Glénat"},{"code":"d","value":"1994"},{"code":"h","value":"1994-01-01"},{"code":"9","value":"id:7"}]},{"tag":"214","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Grenoble"},{"code":"b","value":"Grenoble"},{"code":"c","value":"Glénat"},{"code":"d","value":"1994"},{"code":"h","value":"1994-01-01"},{"code":"9","value":"id:7"}]},{"tag":"225","ind1":"2","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Dayak."},{"code":"9","value":"id:8"}]},{"tag":"410","ind1":" ","ind2":"0","subfields":[{"code":"t","value":"Dayak."},{"code":"9","value":"id:8"}]},{"tag":"676","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"760"},{"code":"l","value":"Arts graphiques - graphisme"},{"code":"9","value":"id:77"}]},{"tag":"896","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"http://127.0.0.1:8088/pmb/opac_css/thumbnail.php?type=1&id=10&database=bibli"}]},{"tag":"995","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Fonds propre"},{"code":"c","value":"Fonds propre"},{"code":"f","value":"33700003669485"},{"code":"k","value":"BD ADA"},{"code":"r","value":"uu"},{"code":"q","value":"u"}]},{"tag":"996","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"f","value":"33700003669485"},{"code":"k","value":"BD ADA"},{"code":"m","value":"20040804"},{"code":"n","value":"20040804"},{"code":"a","value":"Fonds propre"},{"code":"b","value":"2"},{"code":"v","value":"Bibliothèque principale"},{"code":"x","value":"Albums Enfants"},{"code":"e","value":"Livre"},{"code":"1","value":"Perdu"},{"code":"9","value":"expl_id:11"},{"code":"9","value":"create_date:2005-01-01 00:00:00"},{"code":"9","value":"expl_cb:33700003669485"},{"code":"9","value":"expl_cote:BD ADA"},{"code":"9","value":"expl_statut:12"},{"code":"9","value":"statut_libelle:Perdu"},{"code":"9","value":"expl_typdoc:1"},{"code":"9","value":"tdoc_libelle:Livre"},{"code":"9","value":"expl_section:26"},{"code":"9","value":"section_libelle:Albums Enfants"},{"code":"9","value":"expl_owner:2"},{"code":"9","value":"lender_libelle:Fonds propre"},{"code":"9","value":"codestat_libelle:Adultes"},{"code":"9","value":"statisdoc_codage_import:a"},{"code":"9","value":"expl_date_retour:2004-08-04"},{"code":"9","value":"expl_date_depot:2004-08-04"},{"code":"9","value":"pret_flag:0"},{"code":"9","value":"location_libelle:Bibliothèque principale"}]},{"tag":"606","ind1":" ","ind2":"1","subfields":[{"code":"9","value":"id:1414"},{"code":"9","value":"lang:fr_FR"},{"code":"9","value":"idthes:1"},{"code":"a","value":"Science-fiction"}]},{"tag":"801","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"INTERNE"},{"code":"b","value":"FR"},{"code":"c","value":"20260926"}]}],"marc_dialect":"unimarc","item_tag":"995"},"normalized_payload":{"title":"La chambre verte","subtitle":null,"responsibility_statement":"Adamov, Philippe","authors":["Adamov, Philippe"],"publisher":"Glénat","place_of_publication":"Grenoble","publication_year":"1994","edition_statement":null,"language":"fre","isbn":"2-7234-1727-1","issn":null,"subjects":["Science-fiction"],"item_type":"am","external_key":"10","parser_version":"marc_v2","detected_delimiter":null,"items":[{"source_item_code":"33700003669485","call_number":"BD ADA","note":null,"owner":"Fonds propre","item_type":"uu","public":"u","status":null}],"material_type":"livro","extent":"47 p.","pages":47,"series":"Dayak.","notes":"La nouvelle Addis Abeba est née !Fini le ghetto, sa misère et sa crasse... Simon Colbius, leader de la C.P.M., a fait surgir une mégalopole où les techniques les plus sophistiquées côtoient les traditions les plus anciennes.Un monde où P'tit Caille est devenu le valet de chambre du nouveau despote et Cori une courtisane que le nouveau comportement de Dayak trouble à peine.Car Dayak sait maintenant qu'il est le frère de Simon, il a retrouvé dans de lointains souvenirs la vision fugace de cette Chambre verte où, enfants, ils percevaient les formidables changements que leur père orchestrait.Devenu le clone de Simon, Dayak parviendra-t-il à briser les chaînes qui le relient à ce frère qui se rêve maître de l'Afrique et empereur d'un nouvel âge ?","classification":"760","contributors":[{"name":"Adamov, Philippe","nature":"person","role":"autor","role_code":"070","primary":true,"dates":"1956-....","authority_ref":null,"tag":"700"}]}},{"row_no":11,"external_key":"11","item_type":"am","title":"Le chirurgien hollandais","subtitle":null,"responsibility_statement":"Lamquet, Chris","authors":["Lamquet, Chris"],"publisher":"Glénat","place_of_publication":"Grenoble","publication_year":"1996","edition_statement":null,"language":"fre","isbn":"2-7234-2062-0","issn":null,"subjects":["Bande dessinée"],"raw_payload":{"leader":"03043nam0 22002531i 450 ","fields":[{"tag":"001","value":"11"},{"tag":"100","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"20050101u        u  u0frey50  "}]},{"tag":"009","value":"  \u001fa1996-01-01\u001fc2005-01-01 00:00:00\u001fu2010-09-21 13:55:07"},{"tag":"200","ind1":"1","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Le chirurgien hollandais"}]},{"tag":"010","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"2-7234-2062-0"}]},{"tag":"101","ind1":"0","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"fre"}]},{"tag":"215","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"47 p."},{"code":"c","value":"ill. en coul., couv. ill. en coul."},{"code":"d","value":"32 cm"}]},{"tag":"330","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Ile de Java, région de Semarang en 1897. Un décor exotique pour une aventure riche en rebondissements. Ironie et drame se conjugent pour ce premier tome d'une nouvelle série qui confirme le talent de Christian Lamquet.\nUn chirurgien hollandais a découvert un crâne qu'il cherche à faire authentifier comme l'un des chaînons manquant de l'histoire de l'homme. Autour de lui, des personnages haut en couleurs : savants baroques, veuve éplorée, la guenon Lucy, un journaliste zélé, une femme qui ne rêve que de maternité. Et enfin : Pete, le crâne, lui-même personnage central de ce récit utilisant habilement théosophie, un mélange d'occultisme et de spiritisme, et anthropologie.\nParce qu'il est convaincu d'avoir mis à jour des fossiles du fameux \"chaînon manquant\", Jacob Boos, un chirurgien hollandais en garnison à Semarang, est bien décidé à remuer ciel, terre, océan et bonne conscience pour prouver au monde la réalité de sa découverte...\n\" Pete \" comme il le surnomme affectueusement, était-il vraiment ce petit \"homme-singe debout\" parcourant la savane voici deux millions d'années ?\nPour l'heure, ce qu'il a laissé de lui sommeille dans une valise : quelques bouts de vertèbres, un crâne, un morceau de mâchoire. Si Jacob y investit tous ses espoirs, d'autres vont y engluer les précieuses reliques dans les délires de leurs utopies, de leurs passions ou de leur bêtises...\n Et puis tous ces malheurs qui se succèdent...\nPete, du fond de sa valise, porterait-il la poisse ?  "}]},{"tag":"319","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Aucun droit spécifique"}]},{"tag":"700","ind1":" ","ind2":"1","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Lamquet"},{"code":"b","value":"Chris"},{"code":"4","value":"070"},{"code":"f","value":"1954-...."},{"code":"9","value":"id:10"}]},{"tag":"210","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Grenoble"},{"code":"b","value":"Grenoble"},{"code":"c","value":"Glénat"},{"code":"d","value":"1996"},{"code":"h","value":"1996-01-01"},{"code":"9","value":"id:7"}]},{"tag":"214","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Grenoble"},{"code":"b","value":"Grenoble"},{"code":"c","value":"Glénat"},{"code":"d","value":"1996"},{"code":"h","value":"1996-01-01"},{"code":"9","value":"id:7"}]},{"tag":"676","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"760"},{"code":"l","value":"Arts graphiques - graphisme"},{"code":"9","value":"id:77"}]},{"tag":"896","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"http://127.0.0.1:8088/pmb/opac_css/thumbnail.php?type=1&id=11&database=bibli"}]},{"tag":"995","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Fonds propre"},{"code":"c","value":"Fonds propre"},{"code":"f","value":"33700004243164"},{"code":"k","value":"JBD LAM"},{"code":"r","value":"uu"},{"code":"q","value":"u"}]},{"tag":"996","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"f","value":"33700004243164"},{"code":"k","value":"JBD LAM"},{"code":"m","value":"20040804"},{"code":"n","value":"20040804"},{"code":"a","value":"Fonds propre"},{"code":"b","value":"2"},{"code":"v","value":"Bibliothèque principale"},{"code":"x",